   "source": [
    "# 07 网格世界导航：噪声定位 + 路径规划\n",
    "\n",
    "**目标**：用一个简化的导航场景体会 RL 在定位/规划交叉点的应用。\n",
    "\n",
    "**场景**：\n",
    "- 10×10 网格地图，部分格子是障碍\n",
    "- Agent 从起点出发到目标，每步可以走上/下/左/右\n",
    "- **关键**：Agent 观测到的位置带有高斯噪声（模拟 GNSS 漂移），真实位置是隐藏的\n",
    "- 任务：用 Q-learning / DQN 学一个能容忍观测噪声的策略\n",
    "\n",
    "这个 demo 帮你理解：**当观测有噪声时，最优策略不再是确定性的最短路**。"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "import numpy as np\n",
    "import matplotlib.pyplot as plt\n",
    "import matplotlib.patches as patches\n",
    "from collections import defaultdict\n",
    "\n",
    "np.random.seed(42)\n",
    "\n",
    "GRID = 10\n",
    "OBSTACLES = {(2,2),(2,3),(2,4),(5,5),(5,6),(7,2),(7,3),(7,4),(8,7),(8,8)}\n",
    "START = (0, 0)\n",
    "GOAL = (9, 9)\n",
    "ACTIONS = ['U', 'D', 'L', 'R']\n",
    "DELTAS = {'U':(-1,0),'D':(1,0),'L':(0,-1),'R':(0,1)}\n",
    "OBS_NOISE_STD = 0.5    \n",
    "\n",
    "def is_valid(pos):\n",
    "    r, c = pos\n",
    "    return 0 <= r < GRID and 0 <= c < GRID and pos not in OBSTACLES\n",
    "\n",
    "def step(pos, action):\n",
    "    if pos == GOAL:\n",
    "        return pos, 0, True\n",
    "    dr, dc = DELTAS[action]\n",
    "    new_pos = (pos[0]+dr, pos[1]+dc)\n",
    "    if not is_valid(new_pos):\n",
    "        return pos, -1, False        \n",
    "    if new_pos == GOAL:\n",
    "        return new_pos, 10, True\n",
    "    return new_pos, -0.1, False\n",
    "\n",
    "def noisy_observation(pos):\n",
    "    \"\"\"模拟 GNSS 噪声：在真实位置上加高斯噪声然后取整\"\"\"\n",
    "    obs = (pos[0] + np.random.randn() * OBS_NOISE_STD,\n",
    "           pos[1] + np.random.randn() * OBS_NOISE_STD)\n",
    "    return (max(0, min(GRID-1, int(round(obs[0])))),\n",
    "            max(0, min(GRID-1, int(round(obs[1])))))"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "def visualize_map():\n",
    "    fig, ax = plt.subplots(figsize=(6, 6))\n",
    "    for r in range(GRID):\n",
    "        for c in range(GRID):\n",
    "            color = 'white'\n",
    "            if (r,c) in OBSTACLES: color = 'black'\n",
    "            elif (r,c) == START: color = 'blue'\n",
    "            elif (r,c) == GOAL: color = 'green'\n",
    "            ax.add_patch(patches.Rectangle((c, GRID-1-r), 1, 1, facecolor=color, edgecolor='gray'))\n",
    "    ax.set_xlim(0, GRID); ax.set_ylim(0, GRID)\n",
    "    ax.set_aspect('equal'); ax.set_xticks([]); ax.set_yticks([])\n",
    "    ax.set_title('Map: blue=start, green=goal, black=obstacle')\n",
    "    return fig, ax\n",
    "\n",
    "visualize_map(); plt.show()"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 1. 用真实位置训练（无噪声 baseline）\n",
    "\n",
    "Q-learning，假设我们能看到真实位置。"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "def q_learning(use_noisy_obs, num_episodes=3000, alpha=0.2, gamma=0.95, eps_start=1.0, eps_end=0.05):\n",
    "    Q = defaultdict(lambda: np.zeros(4))\n",
    "    returns = []\n",
    "    for ep in range(num_episodes):\n",
    "        eps = max(eps_end, eps_start - ep * (eps_start - eps_end) / num_episodes)\n",
    "        true_pos = START\n",
    "        obs_pos = noisy_observation(true_pos) if use_noisy_obs else true_pos\n",
    "        ep_return = 0\n",
    "        for t in range(100):\n",
    "            if np.random.rand() < eps:\n",
    "                a_idx = np.random.randint(4)\n",
    "            else:\n",
    "                a_idx = int(np.argmax(Q[obs_pos]))\n",
    "            a = ACTIONS[a_idx]\n",
    "            true_pos_next, r, done = step(true_pos, a)\n",
    "            obs_pos_next = noisy_observation(true_pos_next) if use_noisy_obs else true_pos_next\n",
    "            Q[obs_pos][a_idx] += alpha * (r + gamma * np.max(Q[obs_pos_next]) - Q[obs_pos][a_idx])\n",
    "            true_pos, obs_pos = true_pos_next, obs_pos_next\n",
    "            ep_return += r\n",
    "            if done:\n",
    "                break\n",
    "        returns.append(ep_return)\n",
    "    return Q, returns\n",
    "\n",
    "Q_clean, R_clean = q_learning(use_noisy_obs=False)\n",
    "Q_noisy, R_noisy = q_learning(use_noisy_obs=True)\n",
    "\n",
    "def smooth(x, w=50):\n",
    "    x = np.array(x)\n",
    "    return np.convolve(x, np.ones(w)/w, mode='valid')\n",
    "\n",
    "plt.figure(figsize=(10, 4))\n",
    "plt.plot(smooth(R_clean), label='Clean observation')\n",
    "plt.plot(smooth(R_noisy), label=f'Noisy observation (σ={OBS_NOISE_STD})')\n",
    "plt.xlabel('Episode'); plt.ylabel('Return (smoothed)')\n",
    "plt.title('Q-learning: clean vs noisy observations')\n",
    "plt.legend(); plt.grid(True); plt.show()"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 2. 可视化两个策略\n",
    "\n",
    "看噪声策略和干净策略在真实位置上的动作选择差异。"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "def plot_policy(Q, title):\n",
    "    fig, ax = visualize_map()\n",
    "    arrows = {'U':(0,0.3),'D':(0,-0.3),'L':(-0.3,0),'R':(0.3,0)}\n",
    "    for r in range(GRID):\n",
    "        for c in range(GRID):\n",
    "            if (r,c) in OBSTACLES or (r,c) == GOAL:\n",
    "                continue\n",
    "            best = ACTIONS[np.argmax(Q[(r,c)])]\n",
    "            dx, dy = arrows[best]\n",
    "            ax.arrow(c+0.5, GRID-r-0.5, dx, dy, head_width=0.15, color='red')\n",
    "    ax.set_title(title)\n",
    "    plt.show()\n",
    "\n",
    "plot_policy(Q_clean, 'Policy from clean observations')\n",
    "plot_policy(Q_noisy, 'Policy from noisy observations')"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 3. 思考与扩展\n",
    "\n",
    "**观察**：\n",
    "- 噪声越大，学到的策略往往更"保守"（远离障碍）\n",
    "- 噪声策略最终回报 < 干净策略，但比"用干净策略 + 噪声推理"鲁棒\n",
    "\n",
    "**真实业务对应**：\n",
    "- 在 GPS 噪声大的区域（峡谷），路径规划应保守、避免在分歧路口贴边走\n",
    "- 这就是为什么真实导航 app 在隧道附近会让你提前换道\n",
    "\n",
    "**扩展练习**：\n",
    "1. 把状态从 `(r,c)` 换成 `(r,c, last_3_actions)`，看是否更鲁棒\n",
    "2. 加一个\"观测置信度\"作为 state 一部分，模拟 DOP\n",
    "3. 用 DQN 替代 Q-table，扩到 50×50 地图\n",
    "4. 给观测加上**有偏漂移**（不只是高斯噪声），看策略怎么应对"
   ]
  }
 ],
